OL,3,CStag shot after man injured during
OL,4,Cpicnic at Richmond Park
OL,6,FA stag has been shot after a man in
OL,7,Fhis 60s was injured by a deer in a
OL,8,FLondon park while having a picnic.
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police said officers
OL,11,Fhad been called by the London
OL,12,FAmbulance Service at 6.23pm on
OL,13,FSaturday to reports of a man injured
OL,14,Fby a deer in Richmond Park, south-west
OL,15,FLondon.
OL,17,FPolice and ambulance staff found a man
OL,18,Fin his 60s with chest injuries.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
