OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787053674
OL,3,CStag shot after man injured during
OL,4,Cpicnic at Richmond Park
OL,6,FHe was taken to hospital where the
OL,7,Fwounds were assessed as neither life-
OL,8,Fchanging nor life threatening, the
OL,9,Fforce added.
OL,11,FOn Monday, a Royal Parks spokesperson
OL,12,Fsaid a man had been injured by a stag
OL,13,Fat the weekend after the animal
OL,14,Fapproached his picnic group looking
OL,15,Ffor food.
OL,17,FThe spokesperson said: "We understand
OL,18,Ffrom the police that thankfully the
OL,19,Finjuries were not life-threatening.
OL,26,@yD@XOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/7
