OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787053674
OL,3,CStag shot after man injured during
OL,4,Cpicnic at Richmond Park
OL,6,F"Sadly, the stag's behaviour meant
OL,7,Fthat it had to be put down as it was
OL,8,Fdeemed to be a danger to visitors.
OL,10,F"We suspect that this particular stag
OL,11,Fmay have learnt to associate visitors
OL,12,Fwith food.
OL,14,F"If visitors follow our advice and do
OL,15,Fnot feed or interfere with the deer,
OL,16,Fit is highly unlikely that they will
OL,17,Fexhibit this type of behaviour."
OL,19,FThe stag was shot by a Royal Parks
OL,20,Fwildlife officer, the charity said.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUvD@AOUyD@`O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787053674
OL,3,CStag shot after man injured during
OL,4,Cpicnic at Richmond Park
OL,6,FRoyal Parks said they were "shocked
OL,7,Fand alarmed" to see videos and
OL,8,Fphotographs circulating online of park
OL,9,Fvisitors approaching deer in nearby
OL,10,FBushy Park, after issuing a warning of
OL,11,Fthe danger of feeding and approaching
OL,12,Fthe animals.
OL,14,FThe spokesperson said: "This is highly
OL,15,Fdangerous behaviour.
OL,17,F"Deer in Bushy and Richmond Parks are
OL,18,Fwild animals and should never be fed,
OL,19,Fapproached or touched.
OL,26,@nD@\OUoD@LO]vD@XOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787053674
OL,3,CStag shot after man injured during
OL,4,Cpicnic at Richmond Park
OL,6,F"Repeated feeding can cause deer to
OL,7,Flose their natural wariness of people
OL,8,Fand seek out food from visitors,
OL,9,Fcreating risks for both people and
OL,10,Fwildlife.
OL,12,F"Getting this close, and offering
OL,13,Ffood, puts people at real risk of
OL,14,Fserious injury."
OL,16,FThey added: "Our advice is simple.
OL,17,FKeep at least 50 metres away, never
OL,18,Ffeed or touch the deer, and if one
OL,19,Fcomes towards you, put all food and
OL,20,Fpackaging out of sight and move away
OL,21,Fslowly and calmly.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@PO]xD@MOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787053674
OL,3,CStag shot after man injured during
OL,4,Cpicnic at Richmond Park
OL,6,F"Do not try to move the deer away
OL,7,Fyourself."
OL,9,FRoyal Parks said that anyone who
OL,10,Fwitnesses someone putting themselves,
OL,11,Fothers or the deer at risk should not
OL,12,Fintervene but report it to police
OL,13,Fimmediately.
OL,15,FRichmond Park traces its origins to
OL,16,F1625, when Charles I took his court to
OL,17,Fnearby Richmond Palace to escape the
OL,18,Fplague in London and turned it into a
OL,19,Fhunting park, according to the Royal
OL,20,FParks website.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/7
