FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787053674
OL,3,CStag shot after man injured during
OL,4,Cpicnic at Richmond Park
OL,6,FIt is popular with joggers and
OL,7,Fcyclists and is home to 600-strong
OL,8,Fherds of red and fallow deer.
OL,10,FThe deer have roamed the park, which
OL,11,Fspans some 2,500 acres, since 1637.
OL,13,FNearby Bushy Park, which is more than
OL,14,F1,000 acres in size, is also home to
OL,15,Fdeer.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/7
